hared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2737980/extras/de1d5ddbd3be1bf987d2d61db3c849ce.avif?t=1724996569\" width=616 height=230 /></span><br><strong>Sana Inui</strong><br><i>Voice: Misono Moriya</i><br>Sana looks up to Miu\u2014a senior one year ahead of her\u2014and dreams of becoming a cute girl just like her.<br>She\u2019s energetic, good-natured, and kind to everyone she meets... unless you\u2019re a boy; then her emotions might flip on a dime, making her liable to tear you a new one.<br>You're joining a merged class with her this semester, and uh-oh. Guess what you are?",
